    "type_designations": ["DHV3000", "DHV3200"],
    "description": "Semi positive displacement rotary piston water meters with wet mechanical indicating device with protected registered drums. DHV3000 has a brass body and DHV3200 a composite body, each divided into two parts connected by screw, with connecting screw threads, an inlet strainer, a wet measuring unit with a piston and mechanical transmission, rubber O-ring, and a mechanical indicating device protected by a plastic cover. The mechanical indicating device is formed by numbered rollers with eight drums installed in a capsule filled with special liquid. The meters are not designed to measure reverse flow. Intended for mounting on pipework with the flow axis in the horizontal or vertical (bottom-to-top and top-to-bottom) plane, with the indicating device positioned at the top or at the side."
